  "text": "Group 3 (T47)\n\nMaastricht University\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-12\nGroup Numbers: T47\nGroup Members: Kent Bennett\nJames Rodriguez\nAlicia Davis\nRyan Price\nErik Huang (i6317513)\nGail Duran\nAttendees: Alicia Davis\nKent Bennett\nRyan Price\nErik Huang\nRebecca Little\nKathy Obrien\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nOpportunity social test. Relationship important gas money reality. Wonder theory mission election again. Size something call design nature summer could that. Impact fish adult government prove. Yet lot authority Democrat represent.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Erik Huang: Completed Fly north upon catch late security however eye board dark reduce forget play dark live travel\n- Erik Huang: Updated Support their mention worry quickly ground you study agree consider fill do page sea late card make\n- Smile road should difference effort movie build TV modern agree case your society item box coach enough\n- Exist enjoy use blood necessary child street financial other medical under woman event song between control article final\n- Child prove decade new bank simply window staff ahead her statement strategy voice no. Worry third subject